              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono, amang'ana gayö gonsui ni igituubhaniö harë bhaitö, garatököga iga tonge kuigomba ibhintö ibhinyanku, keebhörë bhaakorrë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ëgt 32:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mötakaabha abhasengeri bhi ibhihooru, keebhörë abhamui bhaabho bhaakorrë. Kebhörë ërendëko rëkögamba iga, “Abhantö mbaaikaayë körëa na kunyua, sooki bhakaimöka götenga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9+NUM.25.10+NUM.25.11+NUM.25.12+NUM.25.13+NUM.25.14+NUM.25.15+NUM.25.16+NUM.25.17+NUM.25.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ëbh 25:1-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tötagaacha gösoha kuiraga re gökora amang'ana gö öbhöraaya keebhörë abhamui bhaabho bhaakorrë na kurusikö rumui bhagakua abhantö ibhiköë mërongo ëbhërë na bhatatö (23,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ëbh 21:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guiki niiga tonge gösaacha Ömönene, keebhörë abhamui bhaabho bhaakorrë bhagaitöa na ichinchoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.41+NUM.16.42+NUM.16.43+NUM.16.44+NUM.16.45+NUM.16.46+NUM.16.47+NUM.16.48+NUM.16.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ëbh 16:41-49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuimaahërre tonge körörööta, keebhörë abhamui bhaabho bhaakorrë bhagasaribhua na ömömaraika wa Gusikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang'ana gayö gonsui ngaarë köbhabheera iga gabhe igituubhaniö köbhandë, na gonsui ngandëkëröë iga gayi garatököga bhaitö bhaara tömenyerë gönkaaga ëno yu umuhiko gööra görëngë hang'i guucha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
